{"candidateAnswer":"They support different English football clubs","evidence":"[D13:12 | 4:30 pm on 13 June, 2022] James: Of course, they played well! As I like to say, there is no sport better than football, no club better than Liverpool! I don't miss a single match of theirs!\n[D13:15 | 4:30 pm on 13 June, 2022] John: As a Manchester City fan, I can't agree with you. You'll see, our two teams will fight for the championship, and mine will win!","itemId":"urn:uuid:7a5a8bdb-8494-53f4-887f-de1347b9d012","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:8bd69832199a12350fef7cbce017aae059328d53bf17424611857acce47b634b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Are John and James fans of the same football team?","referenceAnswer":"No, James is a Liverpool fan and John is a Manchester City fan.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"8bd69832199a12350fef7cbce017aae059328d53bf17424611857acce47b634b"}}]}